      "content": "that stillness sounds almost... calm... in a weird way. like the only way he can actually stop the noise in his head is to just stop everything. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if the story didn't have to drag out his pain. if he just reached that point of quiet and let it happen, would that be more impactful? or does it feel too final?",
